{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちわかつき(｀_´)ゞ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/%E3%82%8F%E3%81%8B%E3%81%A4%E3%81%8D%EF%BC%91.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼頑張って指だけで描いた。／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かかった時間、３時間。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやぁー疲れた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ペンタブがないのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無理があった(´・ω・｀)。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"細かい線がかけない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"低クオリティですが許して。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにモデルは居ません(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"架空です(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はいっ、というわけで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"始まりました若月ブログ♪(/ω＼*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんいかがお過ごしでしょうか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無駄に夜中に頑張ったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/05/7323269/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前の買い物での会話。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鏡を見ながら寧々"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『私なんかいもくさいんだよなー。』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月『そんなことないよぉ！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"深川『寧々、芋食べたの？』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月、寧々『あはははは』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月『まいまいは可愛いね』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"深川『え、だって芋臭いって...』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寧々『田舎臭いって意味よ(笑)』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"深川『あぁ〜!!』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月『まぁ、さっき寧々ポテト食べてたしあながち間違いじゃないけどね(笑)』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結論、深川さんは言葉を言葉のまま受け止める素直な子。悪く言えば、天然ボケ(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛いっすね(´・ω・｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というメンバーとの会話を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"挟んだところで、最後に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月がずっとずっと言おう、書こうと思ってたことを書きます!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう何回と握手会を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やってきましたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎回毎回思うことがあって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別であっても、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国であっても、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たちがならんでる所から"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんが見えるんですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で、メンバーが握手してる姿は見えないんですけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっと並んでいた皆さんがメンバーと握手した後、全員笑顔で出てくるんですよ。笑って歩いて帰るんですよ！もう本当に私まで嬉しくなっちゃって。そんな皆さんを見てニヤニヤしてるんですけど。↑変態ではないです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー...きっとメンバーと楽しいお話沢山したんだろうなーとか楽しんで貰えたんだぁ！幸せになって貰えたんだぁって思うと凄い嬉しくて。嬉しくて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっつも、この光景を見ながら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も沢山の人に笑顔になって帰ってもらいたいなっ!!って思うし、毎回、乃木坂やっててよかったなって思うんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しい温かい握手会にできるように頑張りますね(σ*´∀｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていっても頑張らなくても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しいんですけど"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/05/7323269/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これがずっと伝えたかった♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっとかけた(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、ばかつきぃ♪(/ω＼*)"}],"source":"archive"}